:root{
  /* Deprecated named buckets — only referenced while KIWI_BOOTSTRAP_DEPRECATED_SPACINGS
     keeps them in the dropdown (modes 1/2). The value-derived space-N scale and the
     dynamic `default` (var(--kiwi-vertical-spacing-default), emitted in _grid.scss from
     kiwi_bootstrap.grid.vertical-spacing) are config-driven and applied inline below. */
